<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Workspaces (中文)</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/</link><description>探索激发生产力的工作空间。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>马克西姆·赫克尔</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/534-maxime-heckel</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Maxime Heckel&lt;/a&gt;是一位来自法国的软件工程师，现居纽约市。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他目前在Linear担任产品工程师。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;闲暇时，他热衷于钻研前端开发、WebGL/WebGPU、着色器以及更广泛的图形编程。这一计算机科学领域拥有源源不断的知识，他在过去5年里尽可能多地学习积累。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他将这些学习心得整理提炼成实验和文章，记录在他的博客上——这些内容正是他希望自己当初入门时就能看到的东西。这个博客也是他坚持最久的副业项目（今年已经是第8年）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter（X）→ &lt;a href="https://x.com/MaximeHeckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;x.com/MaximeHeckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GitHub → &lt;a href="https://github.com/maximeheckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;github.com/maximeheckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;博客 → &lt;a href="https://blog.maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;blog.maximeheckel.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/51290c69-a48a-4a66-b279-b1841120bb59/Maxime_Heckel_4.jpg?t=1782561893"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b2c38fec-b6e2-4d6e-a891-318c70d1c677/Maxime_Heckel_2.jpg?t=1782561918"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/edfbb91b-5786-4fa8-a22c-482532a45b36/Maxime_Heckel_9.jpg?t=1782561983"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6a93ab2b-14db-45af-b2a7-a0ef439d4b3c/Maxime_Heckel_8.jpg?t=1782562008"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a5a7f174-c050-44d4-9232-38edc0d732b6/Maxime_Heckel_5.jpg?t=1782562033"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/71812809-cdd9-4c83-96f1-82df035cf444/Maxime_Heckel_1.jpg?t=1782562063"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器：2022年款27英寸Apple Studio Display&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MacBook Pro M4 Max，36GB内存（银色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器支架臂：&lt;a href="https://store.hermanmiller.com/home-desk-accessories/jarvis-single-monitor-arm/2548325.html?lang=en_US&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Fully出品的Jarvis显示器支架臂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;桌面垫：Grovemade羊毛毡桌面垫（浅灰色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;键盘：&lt;a href="https://modedesigns.com/products/sixtyfive?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Mode SixtyFive（2024年款），带铜色点缀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;鼠标：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4g3W0fD?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MX Master 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;触控板：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4wd84zN?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Magic Trackpad（USB-C）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/airpods-pro/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;AirPods Pro 3&lt;/a&gt;，在办公桌前或外出时的日常主力耳机&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple USB-C有线耳机，在需要较高麦克风质量时使用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;台灯：&lt;a href="https://www.mi.com/global/product/mi-led-desk-lamp-1s/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;小米米家智能LED台灯&lt;/a&gt;（我估计现在已经买不到了）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;笔袋：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4beLDSO?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;无印良品聚丙烯笔盒&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;书籍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://fleuret.org/francois/lbdl.html?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《深度学习小手册》&lt;/a&gt;，作者：Francois Fleuret&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3R1EbDP?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《设计之形》&lt;/a&gt;，作者：Frank Chimero&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://buddybindery.com/products/bootstrapping-computing?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《Bootstrapping Computing》&lt;/a&gt;，作者：Alexander D. Obenauer&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;（尽管从事科技行业，我其实不算“技术类书籍”的忠实读者，但这三本书我真的很喜欢，而且它们恰好在审美上与我的桌面很搭）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你平时经常使用哪些软件？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://arc.net/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Arc浏览器&lt;/a&gt;（到了这一步，除非从我冰冷的双手中夺走，否则谁也别想让我换掉它）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.raycast.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Raycast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mymind.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MyMind&lt;/a&gt;，用来收集保存灵感&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cursor.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Cursor&lt;/a&gt;作为我的主力编辑器（我仍然手动编写代码）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://openai.com/codex/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Codex&lt;/a&gt;（当我不想手动写代码的时候用）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://ghostty.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ghostty&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://linear.app/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Linear&lt;/a&gt;（甚至在非工作时间也用）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple备忘录（这是我所有信息的终极来源，我会在其中存储和分类整理即将开展的项目灵感以及博客文章的主题创意）。我喜欢这些内容可以离线查看，并在所有设备间自动同步，无需操心。我信任Apple来保管我的笔记，不过我也设置了一些脚本，每月将其备份为markdown格式，“以防万一”，顺便也可以尝试其他笔记应用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://superwhisper.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Superwhisper&lt;/a&gt;（当我想对电脑说话而不是打字的时候）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最近添加到工作空间的一件物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;是我的&lt;a href="https://modedesigns.com/products/sixtyfive?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Mode 65键盘&lt;/a&gt;，2024年入手的。我当年错过了第一代Mode 65，一直觉得很遗憾，所以第二代发布时我毫不犹豫立刻下单了。这是我的第一把机械键盘。选择它的原因是：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;紧凑的外形设计&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;用料扎实：全铝材质，手感厚重且有质感&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;我选择了铜色点缀，为桌面增添一抹低调的色彩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你希望对当前的工作空间做哪一处改变？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我最大的遗憾是选择了VESA壁挂版Studio Display，而不是带可调节支架的那款。我女朋友用的是后一款，调节起来比我的显示器支架臂舒服太多了。既然这款显示器已经出了第二代，我可能会心动去升级一下，终于把这个心愿了结了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;另一个小细节是关于笔记本电脑支架——理想情况下，我希望把它们藏在显示器后面，让桌面保持整洁，因为我的桌面比较小。我看到不少人用3D打印为MacBook定制了支架，不过我还没尝试过。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;请带我们了解一下你的晨间流程——你坐到办公桌前做的第一件事是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;第一件事是把我的小托盘端过来，上面放一杯手冲咖啡和一份简单的早餐（我知道在办公桌前吃东西不是好习惯，但我还是会这么做）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;边吃边喝咖啡的同时，我会处理所有工作相关的事务：审核欧洲同事在夜间提交的Pull Request、查看新创建的问题等等。我其实一直很怕这个环节，因为一大早很容易被大量信息淹没，所以我会搭配咖啡一起进行，让这个过程稍微愉快些。我会尽快把它处理完，以便迅速安排好一天的日程&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;哪个提高效率的技巧对你真正有效？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我有很多正在进行的副业项目，包括我的博客和着色器相关的工作。这有时会让人感到压力很大，尤其是在学习一个全新领域的时候。我总是尝试每天至少花1小时，一点点地推进我的任务清单。每日目标总是很容易达成，并不需要那么多时间。一般来说，一旦完成了当天的目标，我就会进入心流状态，继续推进项目，往往比预期的做得更多。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;另一个技巧是，下班后保持桌面整洁有序；我很少让它变得一片混乱。如果桌面整洁干净，我会更愿意坐下来投入工作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你每天使用的最被低估的应用或工具是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;到了现在它已经不算被低估了，但&lt;a href="https://raycast.com?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Raycast&lt;/a&gt;是我交互最多的应用（除了Linear以外）。以下是我最喜欢的扩展：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;窗口管理：我有自定义按键绑定，可以非常轻松地移动窗口并循环切换不同尺寸，这让我的桌面环境保持井井有条&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple提醒事项：基本上所有Apple提醒事项都可以通过Raycast来操控，比如设置快速提醒，或者用自然语言来创建提醒&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;下载视频（X/Twitter）：任何希望稍后查阅的工作内容都会进入我的个人离线存档（我现在已经不再相信任何人会一直保留自己的账号了，所以我会归档大量设计、URL，以及这里提到的包含着色器、动画等的视频）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;快捷链接：我为每个项目设置了快捷键，可以直接从Raycast打开对应的编辑器并访问其自定义URL&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;另外，特别提一下&lt;a href="https://mymind.com?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MyMind&lt;/a&gt;，这是我使用频率排名第二的应用。它可能是我用过设计最用心的应用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788664849&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=cd11bcb7-065f-4b3f-be2d-af27de46a7e4&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由beehiiv提供技术支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>罗天成</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/533-tiancheng-luo</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Tiancheng Luo（又名 bbbigdear）是一位产品设计师，同时也是科技与生活方式类创作者，专注于工作空间美学、现代生活以及精心设计的科技产品。他通过电影感的叙事方式和上手实探的产品体验，分享那些将功能性与视觉设计融于一体的工具与物件。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram → &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/bbbigdeer/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;instagram.com/bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Threads → &lt;a href="https://www.threads.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;threads.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;TikTok → &lt;a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;YouTube → &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bigdeeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;youtube.com/@bigdeeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6c438768-b421-4d9b-87d8-065b787f5105/DSC00691.jpg?t=1781356253"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d26029e6-c1a3-4cd5-8f65-f84e086d7bc6/DSC00650.jpg?t=1781356353"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1b47e11a-2c6a-4f09-aa37-1de07bdb25bb/DSC00709.jpg?t=1781356371"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f083ab73-6412-4ead-a530-716902177120/DSC00642.jpg?t=1781356383"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2ce43d6a-bdbb-49ef-8d63-a4fd0ebe7a26/DSC00721.jpg?t=1781356406"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/fa4bc797-bcf0-4f10-a8ba-25aded6d6fe2/DSC00786.jpg?t=1781356421"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/433084ce-c5c0-427f-a4c0-47ff009ea4e9/DSC00747.jpg?t=1781356434"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a9cf57db-ccf6-40a5-930d-db8c98101a7b/DSC00761.jpg?t=1781356447"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些主要物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal L型站立式办公桌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/studio-display/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Studio Display 显示器&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Mac Mini&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QeShkY?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Lofree Touch 鼠标&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QmgoOC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Harman Kardon Aura Studio 音箱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4aqVbtC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Bambu Lab A1 3D打印机&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;分体式人体工学机械键盘&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最近为工作空间添置了什么新物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;最近添置的是&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal的L型站立式办公桌&lt;/a&gt;。它彻底改变了我的桌面布局氛围，让我有更多空间来区分不同类型的工作，整个环境也显得更有条理。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你希望对当前的工作空间做哪一项改变？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我希望工作空间能更宁静、更有设计感。不只是桌面本身，而是更立体地营造整体氛围。目前我觉得墙面区域还需要更精心的设计，这样整个环境会更有整体感和秩序感。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;跟我们聊聊你的早晨流程——你到办公桌前做的第一件事是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开音箱。那永远是我做的第一件事。音乐能让我自然而然地进入工作状态。之后我通常会查看消息、梳理一天的想法，然后慢慢进入拍摄或写脚本的节奏。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;有没有一个对你真正有效的工作效率技巧？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我觉得每个人都应该建立自己独特的工作流程，而不是试图照搬别人的。目前AI大约占据了我工作室工作流程的30%，所以学会如何与AI工具协作对我来说变得非常重要。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你每天都会使用、却被低估的应用程序或工具是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;ChatGPT。我觉得每个人的ChatGPT随着时间推移都会变得不一样。经过几个月的对话后，它会在更深层次上理解你。对我来说，它已经不再只是一个工具，而是一个能帮助我整理思路、打磨概念、激发批判性思考的伙伴。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788664849&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=ab3ba0e7-f734-4297-959d-c056ba0949b7&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 13:52:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jack Zerby</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/240-jack-zerby</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/83ffefc4-12e8-4eba-83aa-2833cea00251/Jack_Zerby_thumbnail.png?t=1781142493"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jackzerby.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Zerby&lt;/a&gt; 目前是 &lt;a href="http://gumroad.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Gumroad&lt;/a&gt; 的设计主管，同时也是 &lt;a href="http://dogma.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Dogma&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://designfordecks.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Design For Decks&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://biddyhq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Biddy&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://getdohq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DOHQ&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://Flavors.me?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Flavors.me&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/what-is-goodsie-2011-5?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Goodsie&lt;/a&gt; 的创始人。&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;他曾供职于 &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://pentagram.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Pentagram&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://frogdesign.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Frog&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://rga.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;R/GA&lt;/a&gt; 等公司，并为 &lt;a href="https://teachable.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Teachable&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://americanexpress.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Amex&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://staked.us/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Staked&lt;/a&gt; 等公司提供咨询服务。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/jackzerby?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/jackzerby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82cc4dc3-638a-4519-812b-2f7d886e502a/image.png?t=1781142289"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b0d3e3c1-2144-499a-9c87-dfa47ed0db9e/image.png?t=1781142303"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f52ad4d3-6db1-43f2-8909-43f7de552298/image.png?t=1781142317"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10e73223-99ca-43d5-bc5c-47dc9abef0f8/image.png?t=1781142331"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bf263210-a906-497a-b49e-a224b5da2dc0/image.png?t=1781142346"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/57f0439f-b599-4d90-8837-1a2823061f7d/image.png?t=1781142360"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jack 的妻子最近重新设计了他的工作空间，就是你今天看到的这个样子。&lt;a href="https://alovelyliving.com/office-update-featuring-ben-moore-caldwell-green/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby#/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;你可以（也应该！）在这里看到更多照片以及这次重新设计背后的思路！&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间中包含了哪些设备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;绿色 iMac M1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MAudio Keystation 61 键 MIDI 钢琴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;用于播客录制的 EV RE20 麦克风&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pottery Barn Pittsburgh 升降桌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://diycandy.com/diy-industrial-pipe-shelving/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DIY 黑色水管置物架&lt;/a&gt;‍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;琴叶榕盆栽&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.target.com/p/modern-floor-lamp-with-table-brass-threshold-8482/-/A-85606489?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;落地灯&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你工作空间中最喜欢的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的办公桌绝对是最爱。它既有经典复古的感觉，又兼具现代升降桌的优势。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何激发创造力的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在 Spotify 上播放 Lo-Fi 节拍电台，手机调成静音。我喜欢 siteinspire.com 这样的网站，但也会去 Barnes and Noble 买一大堆各个类别的精美杂志。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我用 Notion 管理所有事务，为每周的所有任务以及每个季度的目标创建工单。无论发生什么，我都会在 5:30 停止工作，吃晚饭，然后和家人一起待到睡觉时间。周末不工作有助于我理清思绪并防止倦怠。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;没有干扰，没有通勤，还可以围绕要完成的任务来安排我的一天，而不是拘泥于坐在办公桌前的小时数。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788664849&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=fd1ec894-f391-4e98-9262-7cdd00e472ba&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>杰克·雷恩斯</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/252-jack-raines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Jack_Raines?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Raines&lt;/a&gt; is the writer of a finance blog called &lt;a href="https://www.youngmoney.co/subscribe?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Young Money&lt;/a&gt;, which 31,000 people read twice weekly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He also edits Litquidity's daily finance newsletter, &lt;a href="https://www.execsum.co/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Exec Sum&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He does all of this while being an MBA candidate at Columbia Business School.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fun facts: He's been deported from Norway, learned how to salsa dance in Argentina, and almost got kicked out of business school for a &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackraines/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;satirical LinkedIn post&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2fbcbb73-0bf8-4377-a108-4ac404a2b846/image.png?t=1781141970"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is the gear in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Macbook Pro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thexebec.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Xebec (the dual monitor attached)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bluetooth mouse&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Journal (not really part of the workspace, but always in my bag)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is your favorite item in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;My Xebec. It's portable and triples my screen size.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you spark creativity?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I've never sparked creativity, it sparks me. Creativity usually hits when I'm in the gym, or on the subway, or at a dive bar at 1 AM. When it does hit, I text myself a few blurbs to review later when I'm by my computer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you manage work-life balance?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;The best way to manage work-life balance is work on stuff that you don't feel the need to balance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What does your typical writing process look like?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I sit down, write for 15 minutes, hop on Twitter to look for a tweet that I want to reference, procrastinate on Twitter for 20 minutes, throw my phone on my bed, close Twitter, grind on the newsletter some more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788664849&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=9f5948bf-7675-461c-a892-8a62fe13d825&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/253-david-heinemeier-hansson</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/269219fe-657a-455e-9fce-87aaafb183ec/image.png?t=1781141716"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;David Heinemeier Hansson&lt;/a&gt;（简称 DHH）并不需要正式介绍。但我们还是打算介绍一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是 &lt;a href="https://rubyonrails.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ruby on Rails&lt;/a&gt; 的创造者，这个开源框架已被数十万开发者使用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是 &lt;a href="https://basecamp.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Basecamp&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://www.hey.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;HEY&lt;/a&gt; 两家公司的联合创始人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是畅销书作家，与联合创始人 Jason Fried 合著了四本书：《&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#rework" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;REWORK&lt;/a&gt;》、《&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#calm" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;It Doesn't Have To Be Crazy At Work&lt;/a&gt;》、《&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#remote" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;REMOTE: Office Not Required&lt;/a&gt;》和《&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#getting-real" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Getting Real&lt;/a&gt;》。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;如果这还不够，他同时也是 FIA 世界耐力锦标赛的&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#driver" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;赛车手&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;推特 → &lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>